# Only dashboard.html needs to reach the public URL - it is fully
# self-contained (every record is embedded in the page itself), so the
# pipeline's inputs and outputs never have to be uploaded at all.
#
# Without this, Vercel serves the repo root as-is and these become
# downloadable by anyone with the URL: data/raw/*.json (every notification
# record), data/brand_emails.json and data/brand_names.json (real addresses
# for the full brand roster). That is exactly what happens on the current
# Netlify deploy - see README/HANDOFF before removing any line here.
data/
scripts/
.github/
*.md
_redirects
.env*
